# AGENTS.md (Drop-In Template)

> **Usage:** Copy this file to the root of a repository as `AGENTS.md` (or `CLAUDE.md` / `.github/copilot-instructions.md`).
> **Design rule (`[C]`, `[B]`):** Context is an attention budget, not storage. Keep this root file **short** (a map, not a manual), point out to deeper docs loaded only when needed, enforce critical rules twice (*guide + CI check*), and prune stale lines routinely.

